{"code":"ja-JP","name":"Japanese","native":"日本語","badge":"日","tts":"ja-JP","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"わかりません。","say":"wakarimasen","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"hook":"wakarimasen ≈ “walk a marathon”: lost on the route → I don’t understand."},{"id":"c1.2","t":"知りません。","say":"shirimasen","en":"I don’t know (that).","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"ちょっと待ってください。","say":"chotto matte kudasai","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment","lit":"a-little wait please"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"もう一度お願いします。","say":"mō ichido onegai shimasu","en":"Once more, please.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what","lit":"more one-time I-request"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"ゆっくりお願いします。","say":"yukkuri onegai shimasu","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"「…」は日本語で何と言いますか？","say":"“…” wa nihongo de nan to iimasu ka?","en":"How do you say “…” in Japanese?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"もちろんです。","say":"mochiron desu","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"そうですね。","say":"sō desu ne","en":"Right. / I see.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree","hook":"Nod and say it: the most Japanese-sounding line you’ll own."},{"id":"c2.3","t":"そう思います。","say":"sō omoimasu","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"本当ですか？","say":"hontō desu ka?","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"大丈夫です。","say":"daijōbu desu","en":"It’s fine. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"いいですね！","say":"ii desu ne!","en":"Sounds great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x}はどこですか？","say":"{x} wa doko desu ka?","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"{x}をください。","say":"{x} o kudasai","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"{x}はありますか？","say":"{x} wa arimasu ka?","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}をお願いします。","say":"{x} o onegai shimasu","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"],"hook":"Works for anything: water, the bill, a document."},{"id":"c3.5","t":"そろそろ失礼します。","say":"sorosoro shitsurei shimasu","en":"I have to get going. (polite)","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"入ってもいいですか？","say":"haitte mo ii desu ka?","en":"Can I come in?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"確認します。","say":"kakunin shimasu","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"会議があります。","say":"kaigi ga arimasu","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"},{"id":"x.W1","t":"お疲れさまです。","say":"otsukaresama desu","en":"Thanks for your work. (hello / bye at work)"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"辛いですか？","say":"karai desu ka?","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"玉ねぎ抜きでお願いします。","say":"tamanegi nuki de onegai shimasu","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"おすすめは何ですか？","say":"osusume wa nan desu ka?","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"肉は食べません。","say":"niku wa tabemasen","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"いくらですか？","say":"ikura desu ka?","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"見ているだけです。","say":"mite iru dake desu","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"これにします。","say":"kore ni shimasu","en":"I’ll take this."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"カードで払えますか？","say":"kādo de haraemasu ka?","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"遠いですか？","say":"tōi desu ka?","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"空港までお願いします。","say":"kūkō made onegai shimasu","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"左 · 右 · まっすぐ","say":"hidari · migi · massugu","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"助けて！","say":"tasukete!","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"トイレットペーパーがありません。","say":"toirettopēpā ga arimasen","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"気分が悪いです。","say":"kibun ga warui desu","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"救急車を呼んでください。","say":"kyūkyūsha o yonde kudasai","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"はじめまして。","say":"hajimemashite","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"どちらからですか？","say":"dochira kara desu ka?","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"お仕事は何ですか？","say":"o-shigoto wa nan desu ka?","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"おいしいです！","say":"oishii desu!","en":"It's delicious!"},{"id":"x.F1","t":"よろしくお願いします。","say":"yoroshiku onegai shimasu","en":"Glad to know you. (said after introductions)"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"こんにちは。","say":"konnichiwa","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"おはようございます。","say":"ohayō gozaimasu","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"お元気ですか？","say":"o-genki desu ka?","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"はい。· いいえ。","say":"hai · iie","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"お願いします。","say":"onegai shimasu","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"ありがとうございます。","say":"arigatō gozaimasu","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"すみません。","say":"sumimasen","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"さようなら。","say":"sayōnara","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"一 · 二 · 三","say":"ichi · ni · san","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"四 · 五 · 六","say":"yon · go · roku","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"七 · 八 · 九","say":"nana · hachi · kyū","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"十 · 二十 · 百","say":"jū · nijū · hyaku","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"りんごは赤いです。","say":"ringo wa akai desu","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “a / the” · は marks the topic · です ends it"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"りんごを食べます。","say":"ringo o tabemasu","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"the verb goes last · “I” is usually dropped"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"りんごを食べました。","say":"ringo o tabemashita","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"-mashita = past"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"りんごを食べたいです。","say":"ringo o tabetai desu","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"-tai = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"りんごを食べますか？","say":"ringo o tabemasu ka?","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"add か to ask a question"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"トイレ","say":"toire","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"薬局","say":"yakkyoku","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"病院","say":"byōin","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"駅","say":"eki","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"空港","say":"kūkō","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"ホテル","say":"hoteru","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"お水","say":"omizu","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"コーヒー","say":"kōhī","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"お会計","say":"okaikei","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"メニュー","say":"menyū","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"ビール","say":"bīru","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"これ","say":"kore","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"袋","say":"fukuro","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"会議","say":"kaigi","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"ファイル","say":"fairu","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"画面","say":"gamen","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"メッセージ","say":"messēji","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"明日","say":"ashita","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"}],"diet":{"title":"アレルギー · お読みください","ask":"この料理に入っていますか？","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"ありがとうございます！","note":"Dashi (fish stock) is in many dishes that look vegetarian. Ask anyway.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"重度のピーナッツアレルギーがあります。ピーナッツもピーナッツ油も食べられません。","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"エビ・カニ・貝のアレルギーがあります。","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"小麦（グルテン）が食べられません。","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"肉・鶏肉・魚は食べられません。魚のだしもだめです。","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"豚肉は食べられません。","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"トイレ · お手洗い","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"男 · 女","en":"Men · Women (女 is often in red)"},{"t":"出口 · 入口","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"押 · 引","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"非常口","en":"Emergency exit"}]}